{"4835060":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"SoundRoom","steam_appid":4835060,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5185410],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—Guess the instrument—<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the room and the performance begins!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess the type of instrument being played.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of instruments increases with each stage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you know the instrument, press the &quot;E&quot; button or left-click in front of it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also listen to the sound of each instrument.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 stages in total. If you get it wrong, start again from &quot;1&quot;.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Easy mouse and keyboard controls<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click operation and camera movement (WASD + drag)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Listen to the &quot;sound&quot; and guess the &quot;instrument&quot;<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・8 stages in total<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear by getting 8 correct answers in a row<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Guess the type of instrument being played<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you enter a room, the music starts randomly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the &quot;E&quot; button or left-click in front of the instrument you think is correct.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the number and instrument match, proceed to the next stage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get it wrong, start again from 1.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Controls<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Character control with keyboard: WASD + Camera control: Mouse drag<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・&quot;E&quot; button allows you to listen to the sound of instruments and select them.<br>If you're using a controller, press the B button.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Right-click and keyboard P allow you to pause the menu and change the language.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Question<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Aren't the instrument sizes strange?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: We've made the instruments larger to make them easier to see.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Is it really at a level that could be called a performance...?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: The main game is guessing the instruments!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For streaming guidelines, please see &quot;Access the website&quot; on the page.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—Guess the instrument—<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the room and the performance begins!<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess the type of instrument being played.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of instruments increases with each stage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you know the instrument, press the &quot;E&quot; button or left-click in front of it.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also listen to the sound of each instrument.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 stages in total. If you get it wrong, start again from &quot;1&quot;.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Easy mouse and keyboard controls<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click operation and camera movement (WASD + drag)<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Listen to the &quot;sound&quot; and guess the &quot;instrument&quot;<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Content<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・8 stages in total<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear by getting 8 correct answers in a row<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Guess the type of instrument being played<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you enter a room, the music starts randomly.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the &quot;E&quot; button or left-click in front of the instrument you think is correct.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the number and instrument match, proceed to the next stage.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get it wrong, start again from 1.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Controls<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Character control with keyboard: WASD + Camera control: Mouse drag<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・&quot;E&quot; button allows you to listen to the sound of instruments and select them.<br>If you're using a controller, press the B button.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Right-click and keyboard P allow you to pause the menu and change the language.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Question<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Aren't the instrument sizes strange?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: We've made the instruments larger to make them easier to see.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Q: Is it really at a level that could be called a performance...?<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A: The main game is guessing the instruments!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For streaming guidelines, please see &quot;Access the website&quot; on the page.<\/p>","short_description":"Guess the type of instrument being played.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4835060\/bea5efa9e4040b7ad1a7fdfecc9d1e36bae0d3fc\/header.jpg?t=1793664985","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4835060\/38c1c44ee3034379748840e73f3f1fb9d7330ea6\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793664985","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4835060\/38c1c44ee3034379748840e73f3f1fb9d7330ea6\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793664985","website":"https:\/\/meyo-blog.com\/soundroom\/","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><